# Slack Incoming Webhook URL — powers the footer contact form.
# Create one: https://api.slack.com/messaging/webhooks
#
# Local dev:   copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in the URL.
# Production:  add a repository secret named SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL. The Pages deploy
#              workflow passes it in at build time as VITE_SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL.
#
# HEADS UP: Vite inlines VITE_* vars into the public JS bundle, so this URL is
# readable by anyone on the deployed site. If it gets abused, just regenerate
# the webhook in Slack (or switch to a serverless proxy that hides it).
VITE_SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=
